1. Create instance and ssh into it
2. Install - sudo apt update -> sudo apt install nodejs npm git -y -> check - npm -v and node.js -v
3. Clone repo - git clone <url>
4. go to the main folder
5. install npm - npm install
6. Edit SG - custom TCP, port 3000, anywhere
7. run - node server.js

if error->
1. rm -rf node_modules package-lock.json
2. npm install
3. node server.js